A||N||17||AusFiero||Oh Man.......Christmas fires, not good||||8||
Z||000000||AusFiero||12-25-2001||02:17 AM||||Well it looks like this season is going to be a bad one. The mountains behind me are all alight in every direction. Our capital Canberra is evacuating people due to fires. <BR>The blue mountains behind Sydney is ablaze big time.<BR>Here is a view from my back yard. We have burnt bits falling in the yard.<BR>Just went outside. Getting worse. A few hours off starting to hose the house down. Look north for total blackness. Blue skies to the south.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bushfires001.jpg"> <BR>Looking north west.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bushfires002.jpg"> <BR>Looking up and west.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bushfires003.jpg"> <BR>Whats landing in the yard.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bushfires004.jpg"> <BR>Looking north east out the front yard.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bushfires005.jpg"> <BR>Looking south east as a comparison.<P>The day is hot, about 34 degrees celcius. Looks like I best keep an eye on things.<P><P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/auschristmas.gif">        <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||8
