Z||000008||AusFiero||12-25-2001||05:53 PM||||Well the situation has worsened in some suburbs. Thankfully the fires on the mountains behind our house seem to have died down a bit during the night. An assuption as we can no longer see the mountains due to smoke and the news reports haven't mentioned them.<P>Roads heading north are all blocked still as are trains. Did I mention I have a crappy hangover  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/auschristmas.gif">        <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
